                                        {Number(vessel.last_position_lon).toFixed(4)}° E
                                    </div>
                                    <p style={{ color: 'var(--text-2)', fontSize: '0.8rem', marginBottom: '1.5rem' }}>Coordinate lock confirmed.</p>
